okploy API dependency. Customer traffic must flow through\n     8\t Yalla; Custo
mers must never receive Dokploy API tokens or call Dokploy directly.\n     9\t\n
   10\tThe dashboard aggregates telemetry from HTTP request metrics, trace spans
, quota\n    11\t decisions, policy decisions, audit events, Dokploy dependency 
